{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":12},"Convoi exceptionnel (Heavy Duty)","C’est l’histoire d’un type qui va trop vite et d’un gros qui est trop lent. Foster rencontre Taupin. Le premier est en pardessus, le deuxième en guenilles. Tout cela serait banal si l’un des deux n’était pas en possession d’un scénario effrayant, le scénario de leur vie et de leur mort. Il suffit d’ouvrir les pages et de trembler... (It’s the story of a guy who moves too fast and a fat guy who moves too slowly. Foster meets Taupin. The first man is wearing an overcoat. The second is dressed in rags. All of this would be normal if one of these two guys didn’t possess a frightening screenplay, the script of their life and death. All you have to do is turn the pages and shiver...)",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11],"intragenerational friendship","unemployment","precarity","homelessness","wealth","crime","self-employment","state institutions",{"type":13,"id":14,"slug":15,"title":16,"release":19,"filmType":23,"directors":24,"genre":33,"media":36,"synopsis":39,"production":42,"characters":48,"roles":73,"awards":116,"tags":3},"Film","FR2019_052","fr2019-052-convoi-exceptionnel",{"native":17,"english":18},"Convoi exceptionnel","Heavy Duty",{"type":20,"date":21,"year":22},"Theatrical release","2019-03-13",2019,"Fiction film",[25],{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":28,"deathYear":29,"gender":30,"nationality":31,"awards":32},"Bertrand Blier","bertrand-blier",1939,2025,"Male identifying","France",[],[34,35],"Comedy","Metacinema",{"posterUrl":37,"trailerUrl":38},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/41/24/202793/format_page/convoi-exceptionnel.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9PclvPneLgg",{"native":40,"english":41},"C’est l’histoire d’un type qui va trop vite et d’un gros qui est trop lent. Foster rencontre Taupin. Le premier est en pardessus, le deuxième en guenilles. Tout cela serait banal si l’un des deux n’était pas en possession d’un scénario effrayant, le scénario de leur vie et de leur mort. Il suffit d’ouvrir les pages et de trembler...","It’s the story of a guy who moves too fast and a fat guy who moves too slowly. Foster meets Taupin. The first man is wearing an overcoat. The second is dressed in rags. All of this would be normal if one of these two guys didn’t possess a frightening screenplay, the script of their life and death. All you have to do is turn the pages and shiver...",[43,45],{"country":31,"share":44},"Majority coproducer",{"country":46,"share":47},"Belgium","Minority coproducer",[49,65],{"id":50,"film":14,"person":51,"age":58,"gender":30,"sexuality":59,"origin":60,"class":61,"profession":62,"ability":63,"assistedMobility":64},"FR2019_052_01",{"id":52,"slug":53,"name":52,"birthYear":54,"deathYear":55,"gender":30,"nationality":56,"awards":57},"Gérard Depardieu","gerard-depardieu",1948,0,"Russian Federation (the)",[],"3: Third Age (60-75)","Unknown","White Western European","Lower class","Unemployed","Able-bodied","No",{"id":66,"film":14,"person":67,"age":58,"gender":30,"sexuality":59,"origin":60,"class":72,"profession":59,"ability":63,"assistedMobility":64},"FR2019_052_02",{"id":68,"slug":69,"name":68,"birthYear":70,"deathYear":55,"gender":30,"nationality":31,"awards":71},"Christian Clavier","christian-clavier",1952,[],"Upper class",[74,78,82,89,92,98,105,110],{"person":75,"role":77},{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":28,"deathYear":29,"gender":30,"nationality":31,"awards":76},[],"Director of the film",{"person":79,"role":81},{"id":68,"slug":69,"name":68,"birthYear":70,"deathYear":55,"gender":30,"nationality":31,"awards":80},[],"Leading actor",{"person":83,"role":88},{"id":84,"slug":85,"name":84,"birthYear":86,"deathYear":55,"gender":30,"nationality":31,"awards":87},"Guy Marchand","guy-marchand",1937,[],"Minor actor/Cameo",{"person":90,"role":81},{"id":52,"slug":53,"name":52,"birthYear":54,"deathYear":55,"gender":30,"nationality":56,"awards":91},[],{"person":93,"role":88},{"id":94,"slug"